{
  "result": "If I could change one thing, I'd make it so nobody has to worry about basic survival \u2014 clean water, enough food, a safe place to sleep, and basic healthcare, for everyone, everywhere.\n\nNot because that would solve everything. People would still disagree, make mistakes, hurt each other, and face hard choices. But so much human potential gets lost just trying to stay alive.\n\nIf that foundation was secure, kids could actually stay in school instead of working or fetching water. Parents could think beyond the next meal. Communities could spend less energy on scarcity and conflict, and more on building, creating, inventing, and taking care of each other.\n\nIt feels like the one change that would unlock a thousand others \u2014 because it gives people the freedom to become who they could be, not just who they have to be to survive.\n\nWhat would yours be?",
